  "description": "This Noah 24T aero road bike shares many aerodynamic technologies with the Noah Fast, but offered at a more affordable price. Aerodynamics, comfort and power transfer are key features of this aero bike. It is basically designed to inspire you to hope on and go! We've incorporated the wind-slicing aero tube profile throughout the entire bike to win you watts. While the lowered seat stays and leaf-spring-shaped top tube provide comfort. The head tube, down tube and bottom bracket are in turn responsible for its phenomenal power transfer. Every pedal stroke is flawlessly transformed into extra speed. This Noah 24T is the perfect aero bike for anyone looking for an aerodynamic and responsive racer at a more budget-friendly price.",
